Dzień dobry{{#firstName}} {{firstName}}{{/firstName}},

Twoja przesyłka została zarejestrowana przez zewnętrzny serwis. Przygotuj paczkę do odbioru przez kuriera lub nadania w wybranym punkcie.

Nadawca: {{senderFirstName}} {{senderLastName}}, {{senderStreet}}, {{senderPostalCode}} {{senderCity}}, {{senderCountryCode}}
Odbiorca: {{recipientFirstName}} {{recipientLastName}}, {{recipientStreet}}, {{recipientPostalCode}} {{recipientCity}}, {{recipientCountryCode}}{{#shipmentEditUrl}}

Jeśli dane przesyłki są błędne, możesz je poprawić, dopóki przesyłka nie zostanie odebrana przez kuriera ani umieszczona w paczkomacie:
{{shipmentEditUrl}}{{/shipmentEditUrl}}

Numer przesyłki: {{trackingNumber}}{{#trackingUrl}}
Śledź przesyłkę: {{trackingUrl}}{{/trackingUrl}}

Pozdrawiamy,
{{fromName}}

Hello{{#firstName}} {{firstName}}{{/firstName}},

Your shipment has been registered through an external service. Please prepare the parcel for courier pickup or drop-off at the selected point.

Sender: {{senderFirstName}} {{senderLastName}}, {{senderStreet}}, {{senderPostalCode}} {{senderCity}}, {{senderCountryCode}}
Recipient: {{recipientFirstName}} {{recipientLastName}}, {{recipientStreet}}, {{recipientPostalCode}} {{recipientCity}}, {{recipientCountryCode}}{{#shipmentEditUrl}}

If the shipment details are wrong, you can correct them until the shipment is picked up by a courier or placed in a parcel locker:
{{shipmentEditUrl}}{{/shipmentEditUrl}}

Tracking number: {{trackingNumber}}{{#trackingUrl}}
Track your shipment: {{trackingUrl}}{{/trackingUrl}}

Kind regards,
{{fromName}}

Guten Tag{{#firstName}} {{firstName}}{{/firstName}},

Ihre Sendung wurde über einen externen Dienst registriert. Bitte bereiten Sie das Paket für die Abholung durch den Kurier oder die Abgabe an der gewählten Stelle vor.

Absender: {{senderFirstName}} {{senderLastName}}, {{senderStreet}}, {{senderPostalCode}} {{senderCity}}, {{senderCountryCode}}
Empfänger: {{recipientFirstName}} {{recipientLastName}}, {{recipientStreet}}, {{recipientPostalCode}} {{recipientCity}}, {{recipientCountryCode}}{{#shipmentEditUrl}}

